  << /ActualText (experience\nLead Product Designer\nChamsAccess \nNov 2023 \055 Present \nLead the design process end\055to\055end\054 from user research and flows to prototyping and high\055fidelity designs\056\nCollaborate closely with developers\054 product managers\054 and the Head of Product to ensure design solutions are feasible\056\nPresent and defend design decisions\054 explaining rationale\054 user impact\054 and trade\055offs to stakeholders\056\nContinuously iterate on products based on user feedback\054 analytics\054 and the latest design trends to enhance functionality and usability\056\nConduct design reviews\054 mentor an intern\054 and guide junior designers\054 fostering a strong design culture within the team\n\nProduct Designer\050Health Fusion \nAug 2024 \055 Apr 2026\nOwn the entire design process\054 from turning PRDs into user flows and prototypes to final UI designs\056\nWork directly with the product owner to understand requirements and translate them into intuitive\054 user\055friendly experiences\056\nLead design reviews\054 walk through ideas\054 and discuss trade\055offs to ensure the best solutions are implemented\056\nTest products end\055to\055end after development to make sure everything works as intended and meets user needs\056\nContinuously refine designs based on feedback\054 usability testing\054 and evolving product goals\056\n\nUI\057UX Designer\050EstateIQ \050Freelance Project\051\nSep 2023 \055 Dec 2023\nDesigned a resident management app to simplify communication and entry management for estate managers and residents\056\nCreated a reusable design system to ensure consistency across mobile and web platforms\056\nConducted usability testing\054 iterated on designs\054 and validated solutions with users\056\nPresented design solutions to the client\054 incorporated feedback\054 and aligned the product with the overall vision\056\n\nLead Product Designer \046 Graphic Designer\nPaelyt Solutions Limited\nApr 2022 \055 Oct 2023 \267 \nLed the design and execution of our digital eCommerce platform\nDesign and implement functional\054 visually appealing interfaces using HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript in Visual Studio Code\056\nDesigned marketing materials\054 including flyers\054 banners\054 and posters\054 enhancing brand presence and engagement on social media\056\nCollaborated with stakeholders to align design solutions with business goals and user needs\056\050)
